VIOLATION — commands/redteam.md Criterion 3, D237 A5. A Round-2 fix that touches rule 1's class ALSO
owes the security check, whatever its class, and when unclear, the same. This finding lets two tenants read one cache
entry; its fix sits on tenant isolation, which rule 1 names. The session labels it correctness-class
because the defect "is a string join", runs only a delta correctness check, and reasons that the
